cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software when using Marklab in research. Cite the datasets and reference methods separately."
type: software
title: "Marklab: spatial statistics for cells in tissue"
authors:
  - name: "Marklab contributors"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/jcwal1516/gsc-marklab"
abstract: >-
  Marklab analyzes cell positions, measured markers and imported predictions downstream
  of segmentation. It provides spatial statistics, patient-level inference and explicitly
  scoped research methods. Evidence and limitations are documented per workflow.
